<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDSMIT 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>GOUDSMIT 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     9.93 vs   6.19</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.1  vs   6.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.15 vs   2.10</p>
<p>    Turnover			     122.9  vs 111.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.2  vs   7.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.3  vs   0.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 3.7  vs   0.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Services group Goudsmit NV said in November it</p>
<p>expected a 1996 net profit of about 10 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
